   "start": 429.47,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "w_i 非负，且至少有一个为正。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 12,
   "start": 434.23,
   "dur": 4.72,
   "speech": "书上没给权重方案，只说近的点权重大。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 13,
   "start": 439.5,
   "dur": 3.93,
   "speech": "所以权重怎么取，是实现的自由。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 14,
   "start": 443.98,
   "dur": 3.88,
   "speech": "本仓选了两组：线性和对称三角。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 15,
   "start": 448.41,
   "dur": 4.21,
   "speech": "等权时，WMA 退化成 SMA。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 16,
   "start": 453.17,
   "dur": 3.66,
   "speech": "三角权，中间最大，两端最小。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 17,
   "start": 457.38,
   "dur": 3.3,
   "speech": "式二点一五，一次指数平滑。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 18,
   "start": 461.23,
   "dur": 5.51,
   "speech": "s_t 等于 α 乘今天，加一减 α 乘昨天。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 19,
   "start": 467.29,
   "dur": 2.89,
   "speech": "式二点一六，初始值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 20,
   "start": 470.74,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "s0 取前三个点的平均。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 21,
   "start": 474.45,
   "dur": 3.16,
   "speech": "这是为了少受第一个点的影响。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 22,
   "start": 478.15,
   "dur": 3.45,
   "speech": "α 的范围，书上写零到一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 23,
   "start": 482.15,
   "dur": 2.39,
   "speech": "实际可以取到一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 24,
   "start": 485.09,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "α 等于一，就是只看今天。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 25,
   "start": 488.97,
   "dur": 3.33,
   "speech": "α 接近零，就是记得很久。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 26,
   "start": 492.84,
   "dur": 3.61,
   "speech": "α 等于零，输出恒等于初值。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 27,
   "start": 497.01,
   "dur": 3.57,
   "speech": "窗口 N 是整数，α 是实数。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 28,
   "start": 501.12,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "两个参数不是同类的东西。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 29,
   "start": 504.71,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "所以换算必须给一个准则。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 30,
   "start": 508.51,
   "dur": 2.73,
   "speech": "定义讲完，做一个换算。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 31,
   "start": 511.79,
   "dur": 3.54,
   "speech": "给 SMA 的 N，配一个 α。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 32,
   "start": 515.88,
   "dur": 3.9,
   "speech": "要求是：两条阶跃响应的质心相等。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 33,
   "start": 520.33,
   "dur": 4.05,
   "speech": "SMA 的质心，是 N 减一除以二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 34,
   "start": 524.93,
   "dur": 1.91,
   "speech": "为什么是它。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 35,
   "start": 527.39,
   "dur": 4.17,
   "speech": "窗口里的点权重一样，平均位置就在正中。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 36,
   "start": 532.11,
   "dur": 4.33,
   "speech": "窗口长度 N，中心在 N 减一除以二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 37,
   "start": 536.99,
   "dur": 4.45,
   "speech": "SES 的质心，是一减 α 除以 α。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 38,
   "start": 541.99,
   "dur": 3.04,
   "speech": "这是几何级数的一阶矩。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 39,
   "start": 545.58,
   "dur": 3.01,
   "speech": "两者相等，解出 α。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 40,
   "start": 549.15,
   "dur": 3.28,
   "speech": "解出来是二除以 N 加一。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 41,
   "start": 552.97,
   "dur": 3.73,
   "speech": "这一步，书上没有，是本仓的推导。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 42,
   "start": 557.26,
   "dur": 3.69,
   "speech": "这个换算，只保证一阶矩相等。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 43,
   "start": 561.49,
   "dur": 4,
   "speech": "它不保证方差，也不保证高阶形状。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 44,
   "start": 566.04,
   "dur": 3.25,
   "speech": "但作为起点，它比拍脑袋强。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 45,
   "start": 569.85,
   "dur": 4.09,
   "speech": "N 等于二十，α 等于二十一分之二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 46,
   "start": 574.49,
   "dur": 2.77,
   "speech": "约等于零点零九五二。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 47,
   "start": 577.81,
   "dur": 2.49,
   "speech": "这个数字后面要用。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 48,
   "start": 580.85,
   "dur": 2.08,
   "speech": "它不是巧合。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 49,
   "start": 583.48,
   "dur": 3.37,
   "speech": "它说的是：平均等待时间相等。"
  },
  {
   "scene": "definitions",
   "index": 50,
   "start": 587.4,
   "dur": 1.86,
   "speech": "仅此而已。"
  },
  {
